# Copy to .env and fill in. The real .env is gitignored — never commit a key.
#
# With a key present, natural-language questions are translated to SQL by the
# LLM. Without one, the tool runs in demo mode against a set of canned
# question -> SQL pairs, so the whole pipeline is still runnable keyless.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-key-here

# Force demo mode even when a key is present (offline / reproducible demos).
# ASK_THE_DATA_MODE=demo
